   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi all,</div><div><br></div><div>Recently I changed computer and freshly installed TMB, but am getting an ambiguous &#39;compilation failed&#39; error. I did some googling and most people get this when rtools isn&#39;t installed, however I have checked that Rtools is available. The weird thing is when I install some github repos with TMB compiled code, it compiles fine. So I am thinking it is a path issue or something. Any tips would be appreciated.</div><div><br></div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">#If you install package from source you must have Rtools right?</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">install<span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span>packages<span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,230)\">TMB</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">,</span>type<span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,230)\">source</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">library<span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><font color=\"#000000\">TMB</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\nrunExample</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><font color=\"#000000\">all</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">=</span><font color=\"#000000\">TRUE</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">) ## get the error here</span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Building example ar1xar1 \r\nError in compile<span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><font color=\"#000000\">paste0</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><font color=\"#000000\">name</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">,</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,230)\">.cpp</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">,</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">:</span><font color=\"#000000\"> Compilation failed\r\nTiming stopped at</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">:</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">0.02</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">0</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">0.02</span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">sessionInfo<span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">) </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\"><br></span><font color=\"#000000\">R version </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">2</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">2020</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">06</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">22</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(227,74,220)\">Platform:</span><font color=\"#000000\"> x86_64</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">-</span><font color=\"#000000\">w64</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">-</span><font color=\"#000000\">mingw32</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">/</span><font color=\"#000000\">x64 </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">64</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">-</span><font color=\"#000000\">bit</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\nRunning under</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">:</span><font color=\"#000000\"> Windows </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">10</span><font color=\"#000000\"> x64 </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><font color=\"#000000\">build </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">18363</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n\r\nMatrix products</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">:</span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);font-weight:bold\">default</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(227,74,220)\">locale:</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">]</span><font color=\"#000000\"> LC_COLLATE</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">=</span><font color=\"#000000\">English_New Zealand</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1252</span><font color=\"#000000\">  LC_CTYPE</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">=</span><font color=\"#000000\">English_New Zealand</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1252</span><font color=\"#000000\">   \r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">]</span><font color=\"#000000\"> LC_MONETARY</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">=</span><font color=\"#000000\">English_New Zealand</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1252</span><font color=\"#000000\"> LC_NUMERIC</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">=</span><font color=\"#000000\">C                        \r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">]</span><font color=\"#000000\"> LC_TIME</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">=</span><font color=\"#000000\">English_New Zealand</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1252</span><font color=\"#000000\">    \r\n\r\nattached base packages</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">:</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">]</span><font color=\"#000000\"> stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods   base     \r\n\r\nother attached packages</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">:</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">]</span><font color=\"#000000\"> TMB_1</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">7.22</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n\r\nloaded via a namespace </font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><font color=\"#000000\">and not attached</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">:</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">]</span><font color=\"#000000\"> compiler_4</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">0.2</span><font color=\"#000000\">  Matrix_1</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">4</span><font color=\"#000000\">    tools_4</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">0.2</span><font color=\"#000000\">     grid_4</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">0.2</span><font color=\"#000000\">      lattice_0</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">20</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">41</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\nlibrary</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><font color=\"#000000\">pkgbuild</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\nhas_rtools</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">)</span><font color=\"#000000\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,140,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,48)\">]</span><font color=\"#000000\"> TRUE</font></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Regards,</pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">C</pre></div>\r\n"
