     "<div dir=\"auto\">Thank you, that solved it.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Looks like I was lulled into a misunderstanding with the pkgbuild::has_rtools().</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Cheers</div>"
